    "title": "Broadway Tour of \"The Notebook\" Opens at Fisher Theatre With New Lead Cast - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Javier Rodriguez ,\n1 days ago The stage adaptation of “The Notebook” has opened at Detroit's Fisher Theatre, kicking off the 2026-27 Broadway in Detroit season with a story that trades sweeping romance for something quieter and harder: an elderly man reading his own love story back to the wife who can no longer remember it. The musical, based on Nicholas Sparks's 1996 novel and its 2004 film adaptation, runs through October 4 and marks the first stop for a recently revamped touring cast. Read full article",
